  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FAO COVID-19 Food Coalition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With this aim suggested by the Government of Italy, FAO established COVID-19 Food Coalition (&quot;Food Coalition&quot;). The Food Coalition represents an alliance, a network of Members working together to prevent that COVID-19 health crisis becoming a catastrophic world food crisis, it?s a multi-stakeholder, multi-sectoral mechanism that will be activating and mobilizing technical and financial support for a unified global action for COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
